+      <p class="journal-meta">From Seed to Cup: How We Source Our Artisanal Coffee Beans</p>
+
+      <div id="journal-summary" class="summary-box" aria-live="polite">
+        <h3>Key Takeaways</h3>
+        <div id="summary-output"></div>
